OL,3,AHedgehog among four animals chosen to
OL,4,Afeature on new banknotes
OL,5,
OL,6,FBanknotes are getting a nature makeover
OL,7,F- and the Bank of England has revealed
OL,8,Fthe four creatures that will feature on
OL,9,Four money.
OL,11,FThe Atlantic puffin, barn owl,
OL,12,Fbuff-tailed bumblebee and European
OL,13,Fhedgehog will appear on the redesigned
OL,14,Fnotes in years to come - although no
OL,15,Fdecision has been made about which
OL,16,Fanimal will be shown on which banknote.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
