OL,3,AHedgehog among four animals chosen to
OL,4,Afeature on new banknotes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owl, bumblebee and hedgehog topped
OL,7,Fa public vote in their specific
OL,8,Fcategories, and the puffin was included
OL,9,Fto celebrate marine life, the coastline
OL,10,Fand bring variety to the notes, the
OL,11,FBank said.
OL,13,FWildlife is replacing notable figures
OL,14,Ffrom history, such as Sir Winston
OL,15,FChurchill, on our cash in a decision
OL,16,Fthat angered a number of leading
OL,17,Fpoliticians.
